I agree that some tweaks may be needed to cope with the instadeaths.
In general though the point in this suggestion is that I want to make
less of the armour, weapons, rings etc fall into the category
"cruddy".

I'm trying to create a situation where +5 iron boots and blue dragon
scale mail are highly valued - because they're all you can get hold of
and you may never get SDSM and speed boots!

And if you can't get SDSM, speed boots, etc in every single game then
it will force players to be more careful and/or creative in Gehennom
and will lead to more variety and excitement in the endgame.  Players
will have to modify their behaviour in order to take into account the
limitations of their equipment.

